<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-10T23:36:32.342Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:36:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces maintain a month-long siege of Taiz while Yemeni government troops have seized the al-Jawf mountain range, sharpening front-line fighting. Houthi rockets damaged the Saudi Aramco tower in Riyadh and a Saudi strike near Sanaa killed 22 civilians, mostly women and children; a Houthi-claimed airstrike near the capital also killed 22 people. The coalition intercepted a cruise missile, a long-range anti-tank guided missile and downed a ballistic missile aimed at Medina, and Saudi Arabia shot down missiles fired at Riyadh after a Houthi attack on the East-West pipeline. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-it-s-a-farce-hegseth-slams-impeachment-effort&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/07/world/middleeast/more-than-50-killed-in-yemen.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/nov/10/donald-trump-pete-hegseth-thomas-massie-republicans-iran-war-impeachment-midterms-latest-news-updates&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/10/pete-hegseth-impeachment-effort&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/10/us-house-begins-vote-on-motion-to-advance-impeachment-of-pete-hegseth?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/38100c3c-af0d-440b-8350-823c5e8c80d9?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-us-pentagon-chief-pete-hegseth-calls-impeachment-moves-a-farce&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-who-exactly-is-pete-hegseth-the-pentagon-chief-facing-an-impeachment-bid&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-replay-pentagon-chief-hegseth-holds-news-briefing-amid-impeachment-push&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE0xVGo1dHhVa2h0RUltZ3E0aVNSUHlvQTJROF8zLWpxNnV4LVdvYzFQSnZtVVVJOE5OdDBzcXVmMVZ4RkRVSEpiWVhJbllfQzhQVjVUeFdWLURIeHA1Y0ltMURaQ1h1MFRHZ0doZmlZb2FBYVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/ac059891-af9c-485d-8df3-5146298e9a21?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
